; ============================================================================
; village.tscn — a test village level.
; Sky background, grass ground (with a physics collider), an animated water
; pond, four buildings, trees/rocks/well/lamp posts, lit windows, the C# AI
; agent + item pickups, gravity-driven crates, and an async event manager
; (VillageEvents) — all viewed through the CRT post-process. Reuses the same
; CameraRig / world_hud / crt scripts as world.tscn.
; ============================================================================
